{"schemaVersion":1,"storyId":"poem-market-day-song","version":1,"title":"Market Day Song (a poem)","ageTiers":["7-8","9-10"],"language":"en","narrationLocale":"en-GH","pages":[{"n":1,"text":"Tomatoes red, plantain ripe and gold,\nCome buy, come buy, before they are sold!","sentences":["Tomatoes red, plantain ripe and gold,\nCome buy, come buy, before they are sold!"],"alt":"A stall of red tomatoes and golden plantain with a smiling trader.","image":{"hash":"sha256:c11cccae259d97664910d3489b6c034b4a7569a9e7c76a53747a1b6154472ba4","width":960,"height":717},"audio":{"hash":"sha256:08bea6b08b32d9b397d6ea376fc567208a0a7e640e0a5a5d1696f99c4fdcac91","durationMs":9840,"timing":{"granularity":"word","method":"tts-marks","verified":true,"sentences":[[0,9840]],"words":[[0,1193],[1193,1789],[1789,2982],[2982,3578],[3578,4025],[4025,4770],[4770,5366],[5366,5962],[5962,6558],[6558,7154],[7154,8049],[8049,8645],[8645,9092],[9092,9840]]}}},{"n":2,"text":"Yams so big and fish so fresh,\nPineapples sweet in a basket of mesh.","sentences":["Yams so big and fish so fresh,\nPineapples sweet in a basket of mesh."],"alt":"Big yams, fresh fish and pineapples in a mesh basket.","image":{"hash":"sha256:c90b36a7df3c45024be61b3b36c21006d7d3405f3364779d9e6aab067cf7296d","width":960,"height":717},"audio":{"hash":"sha256:c273a1eb70547c1e59e4de62efa75c3ab6076b0ebacc4b1478ed8e910a656f99","durationMs":9760,"timing":{"granularity":"word","method":"tts-marks","verified":true,"sentences":[[0,9760]],"words":[[0,710],[710,1065],[1065,1597],[1597,2129],[2129,2839],[2839,3194],[3194,4259],[4259,6034],[6034,6921],[6921,7276],[7276,7453],[7453,8518],[8518,8873],[8873,9760]]}}},{"n":3,"text":"Clink go the coins in the trader’s hand,\nChatter and laughter, a happy band.","sentences":["Clink go the coins in the trader’s hand,\nChatter and laughter, a happy band."],"alt":"A trader counts coins while customers laugh.","image":{"hash":"sha256:223201dc0cada5206558a1dbe5c390df35329c6ec2e7c8c0555120c97455f2e7","width":960,"height":717},"audio":{"hash":"sha256:accad3d6e0ae0afd2c553dead6622c1bbbe6d1d1c504649b865523fa1936a839","durationMs":7840,"timing":{"granularity":"word","method":"tts-marks","verified":true,"sentences":[[0,7840]],"words":[[0,622],[622,871],[871,1244],[1244,1866],[1866,2115],[2115,2488],[2488,3484],[3484,4106],[4106,4977],[4977,5350],[5350,6470],[6470,6594],[6594,7216],[7216,7840]]}}},{"n":4,"text":"“Auntie, please, make it small!”\n“Madam, my price is fair for all!”","sentences":["“Auntie, please, make it small!”\n“Madam, my price is fair for all!”"],"alt":"A customer and a trader bargain with friendly faces.","image":{"hash":"sha256:e74f98c23a9a94736497e1c066ba39f62e39766833c925a8e63d6b1f1adce690","width":960,"height":717},"audio":{"hash":"sha256:1b9afec021f7f62e835fd5daa671f9da51ac11980d2d61885c31e10213ecb93c","durationMs":10080,"timing":{"granularity":"word","method":"tts-marks","verified":true,"sentences":[[0,10080]],"words":[[0,1440],[1440,2700],[2700,3420],[3420,3780],[3780,5040],[5040,6300],[6300,6660],[6660,7560],[7560,7920],[7920,8640],[8640,9180],[9180,10080]]}}},{"n":5,"text":"Baskets on heads, so balanced and straight,\nWalking in rhythm, never late.","sentences":["Baskets on heads, so balanced and straight,\nWalking in rhythm, never late."],"alt":"Women and girls walk with baskets on their heads in a line.","image":{"hash":"sha256:b700b6ab01c422838d91ccbc7b50998409c6093df9f9f69f884bea26acedb1c7","width":960,"height":717},"audio":{"hash":"sha256:a9c5d98a4f64a2c0c5970daeae7b4f748a6c23a1b906f5720c67ad036845b6b9","durationMs":9080,"timing":{"granularity":"word","method":"tts-marks","verified":true,"sentences":[[0,9080]],"words":[[0,1009],[1009,1297],[1297,2162],[2162,2450],[2450,3603],[3603,4035],[4035,5332],[5332,6341],[6341,6629],[6629,7638],[7638,8359],[8359,9080]]}}},{"n":6,"text":"Come, come, buy, buy, what will you take?\nFresh from the farm, for goodness’ sake!","sentences":["Come, come, buy, buy, what will you take?","Fresh from the farm, for goodness’ sake!"],"alt":"The whole market sings together under bright awnings.","image":{"hash":"sha256:4202d91f14573645ee0e9fe886e7d39fe5963ea5c57e3fd912da46f902a7ade4","width":960,"height":717},"audio":{"hash":"sha256:6f40adaf9a5b81c52b294b46127b86e27658bca6eb6e6a3af9a6405c658c07e7","durationMs":6960,"timing":{"granularity":"word","method":"tts-marks","verified":true,"sentences":[[0,3479],[3479,6960]],"words":[[0,512],[512,1024],[1024,1433],[1433,1842],[1842,2251],[2251,2660],[2660,2967],[2967,3479],[3479,3991],[3991,4400],[4400,4707],[4707,5219],[5219,5526],[5526,6447],[6447,6960]]}}}],"activities":[{"id":"md-c1","type":"comprehension","afterPage":2,"question":"Which foods does the trader sell in the first two verses?","options":["Tomatoes, plantain, yams, fish and pineapples","Shoes and hats","Books and pencils"],"correctIndex":0},{"id":"md-ph","type":"phonics","afterPage":3,"targetSound":"and","prompt":"Which words rhyme with hand?","options":["band","coins","sand"],"correctIndexes":[0,2]},{"id":"md-c2","type":"comprehension","afterPage":4,"question":"What does “Clink” show?","options":["The sound of coins","The colour of fish","The taste of yam"],"correctIndex":0,"explanation":"Clink is a sound word, called onomatopoeia."},{"id":"md-voc","type":"vocabulary","afterPage":4,"word":"bargain","definition":"To talk about a price to agree on one that is fair.","distractors":["To carry a basket","To cook food"]},{"id":"md-s1","type":"sequencing","prompt":"Put the market day in order.","items":["The traders show their goods.","Coins clink in the trader’s hand.","The customer bargains.","People carry baskets home."]},{"id":"md-sel","type":"sel","afterPage":6,"prompt":"A market can be noisy and busy. How does it make you feel?","feelingOptions":["Excited","Hungry","Happy","Overwhelmed"]}],"glossary":[{"word":"plantain","definition":"A starchy fruit like a big banana that is cooked before eating.","pages":[1]},{"word":"price","definition":"The amount of money you must pay